{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00076",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 3.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Morning. Nice to finally see you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.84,
      "end_seconds": 7.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.04,
      "end_seconds": 12.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.95,
      "end_seconds": 14.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 16.25,
      "end_seconds": 18.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "We came because of trouble sleeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.15,
      "end_seconds": 26.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Right, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.02,
      "end_seconds": 35.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten. A warm bath helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.38,
      "end_seconds": 42.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 42.11,
      "end_seconds": 46.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.58,
      "end_seconds": 49.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.76,
      "end_seconds": 54.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.66,
      "end_seconds": 66.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "And I've been waking up at three in the morning as well, for two months. And I've been feeling exhausted in the day as well, for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.92,
      "end_seconds": 71.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.46,
      "end_seconds": 78.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.88,
      "end_seconds": 84.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.34,
      "end_seconds": 86.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.53,
      "end_seconds": 95.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Have you had trouble sleeping before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.63,
      "end_seconds": 103.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.15,
      "end_seconds": 108.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any night sweats or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.99,
      "end_seconds": 119.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "No, no night sweats, no low mood. I was feeling irritable at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.88,
      "end_seconds": 121.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Any restless legs or snoring?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.5,
      "end_seconds": 125.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.37,
      "end_seconds": 128.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any heavy caffeine or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.32,
      "end_seconds": 131.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.14,
      "end_seconds": 138.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.75,
      "end_seconds": 141.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.98,
      "end_seconds": 146.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.83,
      "end_seconds": 148.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.13,
      "end_seconds": 155.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.82,
      "end_seconds": 166.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.22,
      "end_seconds": 171.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.08,
      "end_seconds": 181.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.94,
      "end_seconds": 183.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.04,
      "end_seconds": 185.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.65,
      "end_seconds": 189.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.57,
      "end_seconds": 191.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.48,
      "end_seconds": 204.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.32,
      "end_seconds": 217.53,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "Just my appendix out, about eight years ago. I did try to ignore it for a while. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.82,
      "end_seconds": 222.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.32,
      "end_seconds": 225.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.52,
      "end_seconds": 230.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.22,
      "end_seconds": 235.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.86,
      "end_seconds": 236.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.32,
      "end_seconds": 240.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.86,
      "end_seconds": 243.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.4,
      "end_seconds": 255.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "I have heart failure, for five years. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.54,
      "end_seconds": 258.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.46,
      "end_seconds": 262.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I have depression, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.01,
      "end_seconds": 271.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the anxiety in your file as well. Yes, I can see the heart failure in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.67,
      "end_seconds": 273.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "One moment, I'm updating your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.8,
      "end_seconds": 292.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.53,
      "end_seconds": 300.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.71,
      "end_seconds": 303.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.08,
      "end_seconds": 315.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "For the anxiety, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. It's melatonin, 3 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 315.73,
      "end_seconds": 324.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the melatonin was 6 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.4,
      "end_seconds": 326.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.06,
      "end_seconds": 335.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. I'd been on ramipril, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 336.92,
      "end_seconds": 343.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 80, saturation 98 percent, pressure 128 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.55,
      "end_seconds": 348.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Thanks. Okay, are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.59,
      "end_seconds": 353.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.54,
      "end_seconds": 373.59,
      "duration_seconds": 19.05,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I think we're dealing with insomnia, probably stress-related at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Sleep apnoea is also on my list. It could also be a thyroid problem, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.81,
      "end_seconds": 376.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.16,
      "end_seconds": 392.92,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like insomnia, probably stress-related, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had trouble sleeping, and no snoring or heavy caffeine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.02,
      "end_seconds": 395.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.45,
      "end_seconds": 414.12,
      "duration_seconds": 15.67,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.48,
      "end_seconds": 417.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.34,
      "end_seconds": 440.4,
      "duration_seconds": 22.06,
      "text": "Let's get a thyroid test, for insomnia. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm going to order a sleep study, for insomnia. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Same wake-up time every day, no screens in the hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.45,
      "end_seconds": 458.55,
      "duration_seconds": 17.1,
      "text": "Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 459.7,
      "end_seconds": 461.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.79,
      "end_seconds": 468.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 469.29,
      "end_seconds": 469.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 470.36,
      "end_seconds": 472.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Come back in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 472.71,
      "end_seconds": 476.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 477.13,
      "end_seconds": 483.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0075",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 484.49,
      "end_seconds": 488.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "So, I come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0076",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 489.9,
      "end_seconds": 495.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0077",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 496.13,
      "end_seconds": 499.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}